<title>JAPAN: Green Cross, Yoshitomi delay merger until April 98.</title>
<headline>Green Cross, Yoshitomi delay merger until April 98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Cross Corp and Yoshitomi Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd said on Wednesday that they would postpone their planned merger until April 1, 1998 from the originally scheduled date of October 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
